ontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2010/EXP-AVE-2010-0168.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0168.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0124","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0124.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-0162","title":"Mozilla Firefox 和 SeaMonkey 同源策略绕过跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 3.0.x 早于 3.0.18 版本、3.5.x 早于 3.5.8 版本以及 SeaMonkey 早于 2.0.3 版本存在安全绕过漏洞。由于浏览器未正确处理 application/octet-stream 内容类型的安全防护机制，当攻击者通过 embed 元素将服务端以 Content-Type: application/octet-stream 返回的 SVG 文档嵌入网页时，浏览器仍会将其作为 SVG 渲染执行。远程攻击者可利用此缺陷绕过同源策略（SOP），在包含嵌入 SVG 的页面中执行任意 JavaScript 脚本，进而实施跨站脚本攻击（XSS），窃取用户敏感信息。CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-0162"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-02-22T13:00:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:15:36Z","remediation":"立即升级 Firefox 至 3.0.18 或 3.5.8 及以上版本，SeaMonkey 升级至 2.0.3 及以上版本。如暂时无法升级，可临时禁用浏览器对 SVG 内容的自动渲染，或通过 Web 应用防火墙过滤用户上传的 SVG 文件，并在服务器端严格校验文件 Content-Type，防止攻击者上传恶意 SVG 脚本绕过同源策略实施跨站脚本攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2010-February/035346.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2010-February/035367.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2010-February/035426.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2010-03/msg00001.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/37242","http://secunia.com/advisories/38847","http://www.debian.org/security/2010/dsa-1999","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2010:042","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2010/mfsa2010-05.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2010-0112.html","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-895-1","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-896-1","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/0405","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=455472","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/56363","https://oval.cisecurity.org