l":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0003.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0198","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0198.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-0232","title":"Microsoft Windows NTVDM 子系统内核权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 32 位 x86 平台上，当启用 16 位应用程序访问支持时，内核未能正确验证特定 BIOS 调用。本地攻击者可在线程环境块（TEB）中构造特制的 VDM_TIB 数据结构，调用 NtVdmControl 函数启动 Windows 虚拟 DOS 机（NTVDM）子系统，触发 #GP 陷阱处理程序（nt!KiTrap0D）的异常处理不当，导致权限提升至 Ring 0 级别。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 3.1 至 Windows 7 全系 32 位版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，无法远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-0232"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2010-01-21T19:30:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:15:45Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS10-015 提供的更新 (KB977165)，可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft 下载中心手动安装。受影响系统包括 Windows 2000 SP4、XP SP2/SP3、Server 2003 SP2、Vista/SP1/SP2、Server 2008/SP2 及 Windows 7 32 位版本。如无法立即打补丁，可通过组策略启用「禁止访问 16 位应用程序」策略以禁用 NTVDM 子系统作为临时缓解措施：运行 gpedit.msc → 计算机配置 → 管理模板 → Windows 组件 → 应用程序兼容性 → 启用「禁止访问 16 位应用程序」。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blogs.technet.com/msrc/archive/2010/01/20/security-advisory-979682-released.aspx","http://lists.immunitysec.com/pipermail/dailydave/2010-January/006000.html","http://lock.cmpxchg8b.com/c0af0967d904cef2ad4db766a00bc6af/KiTrap0D.zip","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2010/Jan/341","http://secunia.com/advisories/38265","http://securitytracker.com/id?1023471","http://www.microsoft.com/technet/security/advisory/979682.mspx","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/509106/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/37864","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA10-040A.html","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/0179","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2010/ms10-015","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/55742","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A8344","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2010-0232","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/11199","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2010/CVE-2010-0232.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2df87babf8eed88f612cb73e25ef1a25c924358/2010/CVE-2010-0232.json","https://github.com/Al1ex/WindowsElevation/blob/e8fa2760f0ea29d1cdc759c623021d5ab7b715e2/CVE-2010-0232/CVE-2010-0232.txt","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-0232","https://github.com/OlivierLaflamme/Cheatsheet-God/blob/b879fd62eaae297b38087b8227dde5f8f0cf7668/Cheatsheet_Windows.txt","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2010/0xxx/CVE-2010-0232.json","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/0ed7c10732f0fdc3eca1751ca377405d5f6f8be2/2010/README.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2010-0232.html","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/remote-exploits/21523.txt","https://github.com/azorfus/CVE-2010-0232"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0198.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0200","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0200.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-0249","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 释放后重用内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 6/7/8 存在释放后重用（Use-After-Free）内存破坏漏洞，是由于对已删除对象的内存指针未正确处理导致的。远程攻击者可通过构造特制网页，诱使用户在受影响的浏览器中访问该页面，从而触发内存破坏并执行任意代码。该漏洞在 2009 年 12 月至 2010 年 1 月期间已被极光行动（Operation Aurora）利用于野外攻击，影响 Windows 2000/XP/Vista/7 及 Windows Server 2003/2008 等多个系统版本。微软已在安全公告 MS10-002 中发布补丁修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-0249"],"sources":["cve","kev"],"published":"2010-01-15T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS10-002 (KB978207) 提供的 Internet Explorer 累积安全更新，将 IE 升级至修复版本（IE6 SP1 升级至 6.0 SP1 更新版，IE7 升级至 7.0 更新版，IE8 升级至 8.0 更新版）。临时缓解措施：将 Internet 安全区域设置为「高」并禁用 Active Scripting，同时避免以管理员权限浏览不可信网站。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blogs.technet.com/msrc/archive/2010/01/14/security-advisory-979352.aspx","http://news.cnet.com/8301-27080_3-10435232-245.html","http://osvdb.org/61697","http://securitytracker.com/id?1023462","http://support.microsoft.com/kb/979352","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/11167","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/492515","http://www.microsoft.com/technet/security/advisory/979352.mspx","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/37815","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA10-055A.html","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/0135","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2010/ms10-002","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/55642","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A6835","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2010-0249"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":["http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/11167"],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2010/POC-AVE-2010-0200.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2010/EXP-AVE-2010-0200.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0200.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0001","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0001.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-0157","title":"Joomla! com_biblestudy 组件 本地文件包含漏洞","description":"Joomla! Bible Study (com_biblestudy) 组件 6.1 版本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在 index.php 的 studieslist 操作中向 controller 参数注入 .. (点点) 路径遍历序列，包含并执行服务器上的任意本地文件。该漏洞属于本地文件包含 (LFI) 类型，无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5 (HIGH)，影响使用该组件的所有 Joomla! 站点。攻击者可读取敏感系统文件 (如 /etc/passwd)、配置文件或包含恶意脚本实现代码执行。厂商已停止维护该组件，建议迁移至替代组件或升级至安全版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2010-0157"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-01-06T22:00:12Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:15:35Z","remediation":"立即卸载 com_biblestudy 组件（版本 6.1 及以下均受影响）。如业务必须使用，请升级到已修复此目录遍历漏洞的最新版本；若开发者已不再维护，则彻底移除该组件。作为临时缓解措施，可在 Web 服务器或 WAF 层面拦截 URL 中 controller 参数包含 \"../\" 的请求，或编辑 Joomla 配置文件加入 `$controller = preg_replace('/[^A-Za-z0-9]/', '', $controller);` 进行输入过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/1001-exploits/joomlabiblestudy-lfi.txt","http://secunia.com/advisories/37896","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/37583","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/10943","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-0157.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2010/CVE-2010-0157.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/1482f62c613998b0fe0690591034b732c0bb2e0a/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-0157.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2010-0157-1486.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e61be9425da7cd98fab7bf6d914282e65c9f9042/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-0157.json","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2010-0157.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder1/cve-2010-0157-1485.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2010-0157_21.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2010/CVE-2010-0157.rules","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2023/Apr/02/Reports/Report.csv","https://github.com/0ahmad